  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added `posting::resolve_cps` to return both the resolved `PostRef` and script text for a post name or `.cps` path. Kept `resolve_cps_text` as a thin wrapper.\n- Added `posting::post_script_for_post_with_options` and `posting_mounts::post_mounts_for_post_with_options`. Threaded the optional `PostRef` through single-mount (`post_script_as`) and multi-mount (`post_each`) posting into `program_options_for_script`.\n- Added `setup_post_options::same_post` and updated `setup_post_options::script_for_post`. `PostRef::Builtin` and `PostRef::Named` match via `post_key`, and `PostRef::File` entries fall back to canonical path matching via `std::fs::canonicalize`.\n- Added `setup_post_options::unapplied_script_warning` and wired it into `script::api::v_post` (shared by MCP `post`, JS `cam.post`, and CLI `process --cps`).\n- Added optional `\"warning\"` output to `script::report::posted_view`, `PostResult` docs in `script/mod.rs`, `assets/scripts/cam.d.ts`, and `env.logs` for CLI runs when stored `script_options` of the document or a setup's configured post did not apply.\n- Recorded the design choice in `docs/decisions/2190-named-post-script-options.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\n`script::api::v_post` called `posting::resolve_cps_text`, which discarded the resolved `PostRef`. It then called `post_mounts_script_with_options`, which passed `post: None` into `post_script_as` and omitted `explicit_post` in `post_each`. Because `program_options_for_script` saw `post: None`, it skipped `setup_post_options::script_for_post` and silently dropped all stored `PostScriptOptions`. `script_for_post` also lacked canonical path fallback for `PostRef::File` keys, and nothing warned when an explicit post left configured `script_options` unapplied.\n\n## Tests\n\nPinning tests added in `crates/app/tests/post_script_options.rs` (all 4 failed on unchanged `upstream/main` `e3ca44fa7`, and all 7 tests in `post_script_options` pass after the fix):\n- `mcp_post_with_post_name_applies_matching_stored_script_options`\n- `mcp_post_with_different_post_warns_about_unapplied_stored_script_options`\n- `mcp_post_with_cps_file_path_matching_setup_applies_stored_script_options`\n- `cam_post_and_cli_and_multi_setup_handle_named_post_script_options`\n\nMutation checks (all 4 failed when mutated and passed when restored):\n- `posting::post_script_for_post_with_options` passing `None` -> `mcp_post_with_post_name_applies_matching_stored_script_options` failed (13s), restored passed (7s).\n- `posting_mounts::post_each` omitting `explicit_post` -> `cam_post_and_cli_and_multi_setup_handle_named_post_script_options` failed (13s), restored passed (10s).\n- `setup_post_options::same_post` and `script_for_post` without `std::fs::canonicalize` -> `mcp_post_with_cps_file_path_matching_setup_applies_stored_script_options` failed (8s), restored passed (22s).\n- `script::api::v_post` forcing `warning = None` -> `mcp_post_with_different_post_warns_about_unapplied_stored_script_options` failed (24s), restored passed (29s).\n\nGate and lint checks:\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: `--lib` and 187 of 188 `app` test suites passed (`post_script_options` 7/7, `scripting` 18/18, `cli` 12/12). One pre-existing unrelated failure occurred in `tests/first_4axis_part.rs` (`the_committed_project_posts_the_committed_program`, tracked by #2198).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed with 0 errors.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Only `camcraft-app` tests and `gate quick` ran. Full workspace `cargo test` outside `gate quick --base upstream/main` did not run because only `camcraft-app` changed.\n- Live UI (`crates/ui`) was not modified or exercised.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNo open PRs touch `crates/app/src/posting_mounts.rs`, `crates/app/src/setup_post_options.rs`, `crates/app/src/script/report.rs`, or `crates/app/tests/post_script_options.rs`.\nSame-file, different-function open PRs (whichever merges second refreshes):\n- `crates/app/src/posting.rs`: #2149, #2140, #2136, #1681\n- `crates/app/src/script/api.rs`: #2101\n- `crates/app/src/script/mod.rs` and `assets/scripts/cam.d.ts`: #2134\n\nChangelog: fix(post): apply stored script options when posting a named post, and warn if a different post leaves stored options unapplied\n\nFixes #2190\n",
